pcscript 1
part X
sketch S
  on fixed 0, 0, 10 normal 0, 0, 1
  point a 0, 0
  point b 10, 0
  point c 10, 10
  arc r1 a b c [construction]
  spline s1 fit a b c [closed]
  d1: distance a b 10
  offsetlink a b [of d1]
extrude E
  sketch S
  depth 5
  reverse
material json {"name":"Steel"}
import I
  step-file "x.step"
